Fixing verify-01 alone will not clear the 8.5 gate. The drags are a record that is entirely her own telling, a ledger-like "Where each reading strains" section, and length (4,315 words).

**Limits of this check:**
- Quotes were matched to auto-captions and page text, not audio.
- Several long sources were read at the cited passages only, not end to end; the source checks say which.

Only `verification-edit.json` was written in the repo; scratch work is in `/tmp/codie-verify`. I did not save a memory because of the no-other-files instruction. The reusable lesson is to grep every cached transcript for a third-party clip's wording before calling it untraced.
